WEBVTT

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:53.120
File 82-712.

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:55.400
Agent Rick Dicker
interrogating.

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:56.880
State your name, please.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.880
Uh, Tony. Tony Rydinger.

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:07.400
Tell me about the incident.

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:10.760
Well, there's this girl,
um, in my class.

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:12.240
I saw her at the track meet.

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:15.200
-You're, uh, Violet, right?
-That's me.

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:17.240
TONY: I sort of knew her,
but she'd changed.

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:19.200
Relaxed.
She was more sure of herself.

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:20.520
Cool, cute.

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:22.000
I asked her out to a movie.

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:23.080
So, Friday?

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:24.200
-Friday.
-Friday.

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:25.720
TONY: And I went to watch
the track meet.

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:29.760
Not long after, this thing
happened in the parking lot.

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:31.240
(RUMBLING)

00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:33.280
(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:38.080
(SCREAMING CONTINUES)

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:44.560
(PANTING)

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:46.760
UNDERMINER:
Behold! The Underminer!

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:51.600
I am always beneath you,
but nothing is beneath me!

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:53.360
TONY: As if things aren't
weird enough,

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:55.080
I look over
and I see these boots.

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:56.280
MR. INCREDIBLE:
You two, stay here.

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:57.920
ELASTIGIRL: Wait.
Should we be doing this?

00:01:58.080 --> 00:01:59.240
It is still illegal.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:00.720
TONY:
They looked like superheroes.

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:02.520
-We're gonna lose him.
-Oh, all right.

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:03.920
One of you patrol
the perimeter,

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:05.080
keep the crowds back and safe.

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:06.240
The other,
watch after Jack-Jack.

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:07.440
But I thought
we were gonna go with...

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:08.560
You heard your mother.

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:10.200
Trampoline me.

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:12.520
(ELASTIGIRL GRUNTS)

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:16.400
I call perimeter!

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:17.560
VIOLET: You're not
going anywhere,

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:19.320
you little maggoty creep!

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:20.960
TONY: I see my chance
to get out of there.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:24.600
But there's something familiar
about one of the kids' voices.

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:26.280
-(VIOLET SPEAKS INDISTINCTLY)
-TONY: The girl, she's upset

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:27.720
and she throws down
her mask...

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:29.280
and it's her!

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:30.760
VIOLET: Oh. Tony!

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:32.120
Hi.

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:33.960
VIOLET: Uh, this isn't
what you think it is.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:35.560
TONY: It was just getting
too freaky.

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:37.400
I couldn't handle it
and ran off.

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:39.200
I feel kinda bad about it.

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:42.000
Maybe I should've said
"hi" or something?

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:44.120
It's not her fault
superheroes are illegal.

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:46.120
And it's not like
I don't like strong girls.

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:48.480
I'm pretty secure
manhood-wise.

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:49.640
What is that?

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:52.600
Have you told anyone else
about this? Your parents?

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:54.520
No, they'd only think
I was hiding something.

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:56.960
-You know what I mean?
-Sure, kid.

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:58.240
I like this girl, Mr. Dicker.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:00.440
I'm supposed to go out
with her Friday night.

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:03.360
Now, things are just
gonna be weird.

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:06.640
(SIGHS) I wish I could forget
I ever saw her in that suit.

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:08.200
You will, kid.

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:10.600
You will.

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:22.240
(MR. INCREDIBLE GRUNTING)

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:23.960
Come on!

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:26.880
(GRUNTING AND SCREAMING)

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:30.160
(COUGHS)

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:45.880
Consider yourself undermined!

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:47.720
(LAUGHS MANIACALLY)

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:49.520
(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:53.760
(UNDERMINER CONTINUES
LAUGHING)

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:00.880
UNDERMINER: Ooh. (LAUGHS)

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:12.200
-Underminer! We meet again...
-Huh?

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:14.000
(MR. INCREDIBLE GRUNTING)

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:20.160
Oh, great!
Now, he's on the agenda.

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:23.560
(GROANING)

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:31.440
(GRUNTING)

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:32.960
-(POUNDING)
-(GASPS)

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:37.080
-Incredible!
-(GROANS)

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:38.480
Meet Jack Hammer!

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:40.440
(BOTH GRUNTING)

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:50.080
Buh-bye! (CHUCKLES)

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.160
(ALARMS BLARING)

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:01.800
(GRUNTS)

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:07.800
No, no, no! No, no, no!

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:10.400
(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:16.160
Everybody, stay back!
Okay? Stay back!

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:20.520
You're not sticking me
with babysitting!

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:28.400
I can't steer it or stop it.
And the Underminer's escaped!

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:30.480
We'll have to stop it...
Bob! The monorail!

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:39.640
Frozone! Yeah!

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:45.520
We have to stop this thing

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:46.760
before it gets
to the overpass!

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:49.440
I'll try to keep it away
from the buildings!

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:51.760
-(PEOPLE CONTINUE SCREAMING)
-(MR. INCREDIBLE GRUNTING)

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:01.040
-DASH: Hey, lady!
-(WOMAN YELPS)

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:05.560
-Thank you so much, young man!
-(JACK-JACK COOING)

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:11.760
-(JACK-JACK GIGGLING)
-What?

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:13.440
Violet!

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:18.560
(GRUNTING) Ahh!

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:23.040
(STRAINING)

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:28.960
-Stop!
-(BRAKES SCREECHING)

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:31.400
-Everybody, stop!
-(BRAKES SCREECHING)

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.680
(STRAINING)

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:42.600
(WOMAN SCREAMS)

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:45.120
(PANICKED CHATTER)

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:48.840
(PEOPLE GASP)

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:50.760
(STRAINING)

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:57.160
(GRUNTING)

00:06:57.240 --> 00:06:58.320
(LAUGHS)

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:02.680
-DASH: Heads up, Dad!
-Dash!

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:07.520
Violet!
Who's watching Jack-Jack?

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:08.680
Dash is watching him!

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:10.520
-Violet, here, you take him!
-(JACK-JACK GIGGLES)

